# No redirects. The embed is always loaded as `/?id=<uuid>` — a query on the root `/`, which serves
# index.html natively, and /assets/* serve as real files. We deliberately do NOT add a `/* → index.html`
# SPA fallback: on Cloudflare Pages that catch-all can shadow /assets/*.js|css and serve them as
# text/html (blocked under X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff). There are no path-based routes to fall back.
